# STONEFALL - the flagship game, and the flagship project folder.
#
#     plain play examples/stonefall
#
# One game, several files, each about one thing. "use" pulls them in; the
# pictures live in pictures/ beside them. This is what any Plain project
# bigger than a page should look like.
#
# A walled stone garden at low sun. Seven relics lie among the ruins; three
# wardens walk their rounds. Take every relic and reach the gate before
# your three hearts are gone.
#
# Arrows walk and turn. Space jumps. Hold Z to sprint.

start a world called "Stonefall" sized 1000 by 640
set the sky to "#dfb98c"
set the light to 0.55 , 0.7 , 0.35
set the light colour to "#ffe2b0"
set the haze to 0.5
set world gravity to 0.03
let the sun cast shadows

use "garden.plain"
use "people.plain"
use "relics.plain"
use "game.plain"
